      "message": "[warning] Line 3501: 🟡 `displayedTokensMtx_` is held while calling `messageEngine_.sendMessage(...)`. That call can trigger non-trivial work (queueing/connect requests/callback paths), so keeping the mutex locked here increases contention and creates lock-ordering risk if future code paths re-enter token bookkeeping. Capture the current token under lock, release the lock before `sendMessage`, then re-lock only to store the returned token.",
